  "bodyHash": "141d49abd77d2ee4",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Forge？<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-keybinding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-keybinding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern KeyBinding</a> 的官方移植版本。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em><strong>一般玩家使用：</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em><strong>功能特色</strong></em></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>您現在可以使用鍵修飾符來定義按鍵綁定的觸發鍵。例如「Ctrl + G」或「Alt + S」；</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>具有相同觸發鍵但處於不同衝突情境的按鍵綁定，現在將不會產生衝突。</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>「非衝突鍵」（預設關閉）：按下該鍵時，所有綁定相同鍵的按鍵綁定都會同時觸發。</em></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>設定檔</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"># ModernKeyBinding-Config</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> # 非衝突鍵功能。設為 true 以啟用。[預設值：false] </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">nonConflictKeys=false</span></p>\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>開發者資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模組的 WIKI (<a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/ModernKeyBinding/blob/Forge/1.7.10/README.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">English</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://wiki.nova-committee.cn/project-1/doc-10/\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡體中文</a>)。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>注意：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">您<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>絕對可以</strong></span>將此模組加入您的模組整合包中；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">請前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flegacyfabric.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">legacyfabric.net</a> 了解更多關於 Legacyfabric 的資訊。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
